{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>西環今日（15日）發生火警。晚上9時13分，警方接獲多人報案，指皇后大道西264至268號一唐樓有單位冒煙，消防趕抵現場，派遣一煙帽隊及拖喉灌救。</p><p>消防在地面架起雲梯拖喉，向涉事的低層單位射水；同時亦有消防員進入單位內射水降溫。火警於9時38分救熄，暫未接收有傷亡人數。大批街坊自行疏散，在地面暫避，救護車在現場戒備，消防正調查起火原因。</p><p>現場消息指，起火單位為空置無人居住，業主夫婦得悉起火後到場了解。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防架雲梯救火。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154181287452348416201795.jpeg/RbOKsLQCVV-1Wd3Gn3KBd0cmzNqhmV41IJCj3RqQo90\"/><figcaption>消防架雲梯救火。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批住客倉皇逃生。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154181888127012864807625.jpeg/6smx-8AicHKIIy8YsbsjP6m13vHZtmlA28KmZOHCpmQ\"/><figcaption>大批住客倉皇逃生。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防從單位內射水降溫。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154181891407089664965703.jpeg/T0uwlWDXrkNdF0meth7SGTHfdin9OumMMm7y1Ahu8tQ\"/><figcaption>消防從單位內射水降溫。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"救護員在現場戒備。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154181894347427840315249.jpeg/lugIQ2GEGYdrhzXxNgzJjWpPO0iN_YADJ-ibcR3om3E\"/><figcaption>救護員在現場戒備。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防正調查起火原因。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154181897501675520721549.jpeg/8j4mRNVOWWJOKQS_Gn5_cgNoLJLoPjn3_X2rT8d9q08\"/><figcaption>消防正調查起火原因。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防出動一隊煙帽隊救 。（梁偉權攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154181900458790912891706.jpeg/ETBLTz0Vxfh1GODIG0l2V9iK_NXpJUCY90m-7M1Jvuw\"/><figcaption>消防出動一隊煙帽隊救 。（梁偉權攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防拖喉不消半小時撲滅。（Facebook 西環變幻時Ai Xiao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154180551742197760204935.jpeg/GdWFYV52HFzH5A7yoMTrCXprA0GXiTpCOoxygjqMcoI\"/><figcaption>消防拖喉不消半小時撲滅。（Facebook 西環變幻時Ai Xiao）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大批街坊疏散至地面。（Facebook 西環變幻時Ai Xiao）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260715/1154180549149986816045279.jpeg/l7a3kNyAKrCJjk2cdIm3RLvtjgWlomIg02Jw4NNicOA\"/><figcaption>大批街坊疏散至地面。（Facebook 西環變幻時Ai Xiao）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-15T14:16:01.435579+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":373,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}